  "description": "The meme relies on the harmful stereotype that Muslims are inherently violent or associated with terrorism, by misrepresenting the phrase 'Allah Akbar' (meaning 'God is great') as a prelude to mass death. This stereotype is used to incite fear and prejudice against Muslims, ignoring the peaceful and diverse contexts in which the phrase is used.",
